The '''Middian system''',<ref name="Shoadw">''[[Shadow of the Sith]]''</ref> also known as the '''Pasaana system''',<ref name="CVNE" /> was a [[star system]]<ref name="TROS" /> located in the [[Ombakond sector]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Expansion Region]] that contained the [[desert]] [[planet]]<ref name="TROSVD" /> [[Pasaana]].<ref name="TROS" />

{{System-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
While ''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]'' places Pasaana in the Ombakond sector,<ref name="TROSVD" /> comparing Pasaana's location on the [[Star Wars Galaxy Map|''Star Wars'' Galaxy Map]]<ref name="Map">{{StarWarsGalaxyMap}}</ref> with the sector map of the Expansion Region in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity places Pasaana in the [[Altier sector]] rather than the Ombakond sector.<ref name="EAOC">{{SW|url=news/essential-atlas-extra-expansion-region|text=Essential Atlas Extra: Expansion Region}}</ref> Accordingly, the [[2025]] "[[Star Systems of the Galaxy]]" appendix of star systems lists the Pasaana system in the "Ombakand" [sic] subsector of the Altier sector, although all other systems in the Ombakond sector simply list Ombakond in their sector column, and are located in a different grid square.<ref name="Appendix" /> The appendix's author [[Jason Fry]] indicated that this was an error, and that Pasaana would either be kept in the Altier sector, or its placement on the Galaxy Map would be adjusted to put it correctly in the Ombakond sector.<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-09-03.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-09-03}}</ref> The [[October 13]] iteration of both the Galaxy Map and the appendix reflected this, moving Pasaana slightly northeast to match its placement in the Ombakond sector.<ref name="Substack 2">{{Substack|subdomain=jasonfry|url=p/star-wars-galaxy-map-update|text=Star Wars Galaxy Map Update|name=[[Jason Fry]]|username=jasonfry|date=2025-10-13}}</ref>

